Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:22.93,title2,NTP,0,0,0,,大家和芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:15.78,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何ページも費やして　つづられた僕らの気分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:23.03,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}どうしてか一行の　空白を埋められない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:31.16,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}押花のしおりはさんで　君と転がす使い捨ての自転車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:38.75,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忘れかけのレンガを　積み上げた場所に行こう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:43.99,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}海を見渡す坂を駆けのぼって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:48.54,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こわいくらいに青い空と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:56.29,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手にサイダー　左手はずっと君をさがしている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:01:04.04,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}そうやって今は僕の方へ　問いつめることもなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:10.95,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}まだ二人はすぐそこに居るのに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.05,0:01:16.92,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}どうかまた会えますように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:26.75,opjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんて　どうかしてるみたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:15.78,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}使用好幾頁 填補了我們的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:23.03,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}卻彌補不了那唯一的一行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.09,0:00:31.16,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}夾上乾花書籤 和你乘上騎一次就扔的自行車
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:38.75,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}前往用幾乎遺忘的磚頭堆積起來的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:43.99,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}爬上望得見海的小坡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:48.54,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}頭上是湛藍的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:56.29,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}右手是碳酸飲料 左手一直在尋求著你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:01:04.04,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}現在呢 你也不會再追問我什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:10.95,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}兩個人明明還在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.05,0:01:16.92,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}而我卻祈願能再次相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:26.75,opcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}可能是我的錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:25.34,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君と夏の終わり　将来の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:28.54,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}大きな希望　忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:35.25,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}10年後の8月　また出会えるのを　信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:43.33,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1400)\be5}最高の思い出を…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:48.55,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}出会いは　ふっとした　瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:52.16,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}帰り道の交差点で
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.35,0:21:57.96,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}声をかけてくれたね「一緒に帰ろう」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:06.41,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}嬉しくって　楽しくって　冒険も　いろいろしたね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:13.40,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}二人の　秘密の　基地の中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:17.38,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君と夏の終わり　将来の夢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:20.58,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}大きな希望を忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.70,0:22:27.68,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}10年後の8月　また出会えるのを　信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.87,0:22:29.73,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}君が最後まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.77,0:22:34.91,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}心から「ありがとう」叫んでたこと　知ってたよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.01,0:22:38.65,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}涙をこらえて　笑顔でさようなら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:41.91,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}せつないよね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.25,0:22:49.38,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}最高の思い出を…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:25.34,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}不會忘記和你度過的夏天 將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:28.54,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}和巨大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:35.25,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}相信著十年後的八月還能與你再會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:43.33,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1400)\be5}懷著最美好的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.46,0:21:48.55,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}邂逅是瞬間的巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:52.16,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在回家的路口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.35,0:21:57.96,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}你對我說「一起回去吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:06.41,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}開心的 愉快的冒險也經歷過很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:13.40,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}在兩個人的秘密基地裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:17.38,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}不會忘記和你度過的夏天 將來的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:20.58,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}和巨大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.70,0:22:27.68,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}相信著十年後的八月還能與你再會
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.87,0:22:29.73,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}我知道你自始至終
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.77,0:22:34.91,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}都在心裡喊「謝謝」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.01,0:22:38.65,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}強忍淚水 笑著說再見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.66,0:22:41.91,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be5}有些傷感吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.25,0:22:49.38,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\be5}懷著最美好的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好燙  好燙燙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷靜點  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久~等了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧  請品嚐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.01,0:02:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一臉自誇地說讓你們品嚐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  我覺得冷了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣  好恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請吧  啊  噗噗塊頭大  給你最大的  給
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:21.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她說你塊頭最大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  是啊  我長得大塊起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃  好吃  芽間！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.74,0:02:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的…給我的是什麼樣的  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:43.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  雪集的是葡萄乾放得最多的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可沒這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間  我想親口聽你告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:50.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴我吧  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:02:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  紙紙筆給  用這個傳遞芽間的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個呢…  哎  寫不出來啊仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼呢  明明能寫在日記本上的  我試試
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  也不是沒墨水了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:17.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再試一次給我再試一次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子  好難受  等…鶴子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.36,0:03:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在覺得好想睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.49,0:03:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  覺得渾身無力了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:37.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間沒有在生我們的氣  原諒我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不知道她肯不肯原諒我們不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？  因為生氣的話還會給你做蒸麵包嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.81,0:03:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可能因為沒有原諒所以為了責怪而顯靈的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不說這事  能寫字的話一開始這麼做就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實呢  這樣也就能對話了  馬上就能相信了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太和芽間腦子也夠不好使的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對  嘴上說要我們相信芽間的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果還是想獨佔她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:27.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久川  安城  打工錢好好存著
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.37,0:04:35.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火要做出來  絕對…絕對要讓芽間成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.07,0:04:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬧成那樣當然會累了的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家說要做煙火  為了…讓你成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會高興嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還醒著嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就好…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.73,0:05:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.43,0:05:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圍著轉~
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間  跑的太快當心摔跤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:06:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}哎  芽間在跑著嗎  那樣的話我也
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:01.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等下  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}搞什麼啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「無法原諒曾經喜歡仁太的自己」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我果然還是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒法放棄呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.19,0:06:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下週的排班能不能和我換換
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,排班？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星期四大橋那邊有個工程  日薪很高我想去那做工
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  我跟你說…對面啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}哦  終於跑累了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？  你們是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:07:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  她  芽衣子媽媽和山大叔說的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.97,0:07:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是阿姨她……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那叔叔對做煙火不反對是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她還生活在過去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生了芽衣子那事後  她的時間就一直停滯不前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.27,0:07:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想把她牽回到現實  為此不要再讓她憶起往事了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:33.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.04,0:07:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松雪君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然會冒犯到阿姨  但我能明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…對你女兒…我喜歡芽衣子！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.04,0:07:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了芽衣子  我想做些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:55.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是一直活在過去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正因為此我才…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.83,0:08:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做出那麼糗的事來真嚇著我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:12.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也嚇了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集還真沒有變呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.17,0:08:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了芽間的話什麼事都…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鶴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:21.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信著的話真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.24,0:08:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓芽間成佛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明對芽間那麼執著  通過宿海還能實現對話  為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通過宿海啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.47,0:08:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:45.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宿海…  這之後去打工？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  今天會到很晚  想先回家一趟把芽間送回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間在那裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:09:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說是不想待在家裡  到哪裡都跟著我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:04.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  想和大家一起努力的說哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好  她說想和大家在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間…  還是長髮嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.99,0:09:21.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  哦不如說這傢伙和我們一樣在成長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在成長？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.87,0:09:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧  為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「誰會對這醜女」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:46.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差不多…還湊合…說漂亮不如說可愛？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼叫還湊合啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.41,0:09:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太個蠢貨  笨蛋  茄子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}囉嗦  笨蛋！  還湊合有說錯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總覺得在看獨角戲似的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:06.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  並非如此呢  因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集壞掉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:24.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  我給你們做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.50,0:10:28.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煙火  煙火
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不能讓你們動火藥  但一些簡單的活你們想來幫忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.35,0:10:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  太好了  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大叔  這就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:10:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很嚇人的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.05,0:11:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  這個是要從竹筒裡出來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得紅色多點會更可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.73,0:11:13.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可愛？  這還真不符合你的形象呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後  在這裡點火
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  那麼這裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這只是個裝飾  為了能夠更加容易地搬運上發射台
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後  這裡也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs19}好厲害  好厲害  好厲害  仁太  那個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:34.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  芽間  很危險啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要放手啊  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗  做好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她現在蹦到你背上了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的  芽間  你就饒了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗噗  噗噗  噗噗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間  明明看不見卻看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:11.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我  比不上她  無論是以前  還是現在  都比不上她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我  去買點果汁來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.93,0:12:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.81,0:12:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幫大忙了  多虧你逃出來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也差點吼出來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間在我們的身邊  我已經能夠接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  我看不見芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能和她交談
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.18,0:13:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好想再見一次芽間  但是  為什麼只有宿海
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是宿海呀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對宿海來說也果然是芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從那個時候開始就什麼都沒有改變
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:14.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已經自暴自棄了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明用「仁太」叫他  又馬上會改口成「宿海」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  你那種好像看透別人一般的態度
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能看透的只是你  這大概是同道中人的共鳴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:32.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要和你這種性格惡劣的人一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  冷靜一點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪集
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:12.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前說過的事  那個  我是認真的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:14.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  之前？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「我們要不要交往一下？」的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的對男性很沒轍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,nice  middle
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}（用來代指不錯的中年男性或女性）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說你啊  什麼nice  middle啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你笑什麼啊  我真的被你嚇了一跳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是值得那麼吃驚的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這一天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞  我燃燒起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  仁太  安鳴的玩偶沒有了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安鳴她回家了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:57.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  真是的  那麼突然  還真是個隨性的小貓咪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:15:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果芽間真在仁太身邊的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.07,0:15:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,願望實現後芽間不就會消失不見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼啦  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到打工的時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已經要走了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  芽間你準備怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.80,0:15:18.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和噗噗在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她說想留在這裡  行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行啊  當然了  非常歡迎  超級歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你鬧得太瘋了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我很高興嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高興的啊  芽間  果然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.43,0:15:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.22,0:15:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你看了那個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬季校服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一開始還以為只是夏天的野獸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:16:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  現在已經穿上冬季校服了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  畫好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間  你在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.50,0:16:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}（你好）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.81,0:16:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  好厲害  好厲害啊  芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.45,0:16:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  但是  家裡的筆記本就寫不了  這是為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.77,0:16:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再多些一點  讓我們再多聊聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.82,0:16:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}（好啊  聊什麼？）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  好啊  那個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.51,0:16:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一天  你啊  那個時候  那個  我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  對了  我們來玩接龍吧  繪畫接龍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.82,0:16:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要玩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂  這是什麼  像金楚糕一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18}（金楚糕：一種沖繩特產糕點）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.75,0:17:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小學生背包  紅寶石  玻璃球  馬里奧  小手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小手合小手  好幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,望遠鏡  芽間隊員  開始搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:40.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:02.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「你所撥打的電話…」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋  打不通  去打工了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼我的步伐會那麼急促
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼我會跑起來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間只不過是在秘密基地裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  我為什麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  喂  這裡  喂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.31,0:19:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  我絕對不要芽間消失
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.39,0:19:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對絕對不要仁太死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.43,0:19:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那算什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不也已經死了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說別人奇怪的人才奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:55.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好  走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.08,0:19:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鯉魚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:19:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鯉魚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,河裡啊  有條很大的鯉魚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,芽間呢  想再近點看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.61,0:20:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  在那裡  就在樹根附近  晃來晃去  你看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.82,0:20:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很痛啊  仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太  在撒嬌嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.74,0:20:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠  永遠留在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.90,0:20:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我  給我留在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會去把鯉魚抓來的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  仁太  會濕透的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.16,0:20:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仁太
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:01.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  傻瓜仁太  要感冒的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.01,0:21:18.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回來吧  仁太
